<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22296" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλήνη</span></b> , ἡ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>eyeball</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Il.
				14.494
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Od.
				9.390
			</span></i>; <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ εἴδωλον τὸ ἐν τῇ
			ὄψει</span>, <i><span class="en">
				Ruf.
				<u>Onom.</u>
				24
			</span></i>, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Poll.
				2.70
			</span></i>; poet. <i>eye</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>OT</u>
				1277
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">Φαέθων μονάδι γλήνᾳ παραυγεῖ</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Cerc.
					4.18
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔρρε, κακὴ γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Il.
					8.164
				</span></i>
			, perh. <i>doll, plaything</i> (since figures are reflected
			small in the pupil, cf. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κόρη</span>).
			</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>III.</b>
			<i>socket of a joint</i>, distd. from <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">κοτύλη</span> as being not so deep, <i><span class="en">
				Gal.
				2.736
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>IV.</b>
			<i>honeycomb,</i>
			<i><span class="en">
				AB
				233
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hsch.
			</span></i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>V.</b>
			
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γλίνη</span>
			 (q. v.), <i><span class="en">
				Hdn.
			</span></i> Gr.<i><span class="en">
				1.330
			</span></i>.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
